cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this edition, please cite it as below, and cite the 1907 source edition separately."
type: dataset
title: "DdT 1, Vol. 29/30 — Instrumentalkonzerte deutscher Meister"
abstract: >-
  A work-in-progress MEI 5.1 edition of volumes 29/30 of the first series of
  Denkmäler deutscher Tonkunst (1907): Instrumentalkonzerte deutscher Meister,
  edited by Arnold Schering. Page-level OMR encodings cover the full score;
  the Pisendel violin concerto is assembled as a combined work-level file.
  Each measure is linked to the Bayerische Staatsbibliothek digital facsimile.
